      "title": {
        "en": "Caring doctors alongside staff friction"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers share polarized experiences regarding the clinic's personnel. While several pet owners praise veterinarians like Dr. Frank for their compassionate bedside manner and thorough clinical attention, numerous clients express frustration with front desk receptionists and cashiers, citing unhelpful attitudes and poor customer service during stressful visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Conflicting perceptions of animal welfare"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Client perspectives on animal care are sharply divided in recent reviews. Satisfied pet owners describe gentle and considerate handling of family dogs and cats during routine health visits. In contrast, multiple reviewers strongly criticized the clinic for refusing to examine or treat distressed street animals without immediate upfront payment, questioning the staff's empathy."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Steep bills and upfront charges"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Sentiment regarding clinic costs is predominantly critical among reviewers. Although some clients note reasonable pricing for routine vaccines, many owners complain of unexpected charges exceeding one thousand dollars for basic diagnostic x-rays and medications. Frustration is frequently voiced over strict upfront payment policies when pets arrive in urgent distress."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Pet Lovers Animal Clinic handle 24/7 emergency cases?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "No, the clinic operates during standard business hours and does not provide 24/7 emergency or critical trauma services."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What veterinary services are offered at this location?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic provides wellness exams, vaccinations, digital radiography (x-rays), laboratory diagnostics, and routine surgical procedures."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What do pet owners report about wait times and appointments?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Several reviewers note significant scheduling delays, reporting wait times between one and two hours even when arriving with a confirmed appointment."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What payment expectations should clients anticipate?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize that full payment or upfront deposits are required before medical services and diagnostics are rendered."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
